  "title": "Palatin Announces 1-for-50 Reverse Stock Split",
  "summary": "Aug 08, 2025, 16:00 ET PRINCETON, N.J., Aug. 8, 2025 /PRNewswire/ — Palatin Technologies, Inc. (OTCQB: PTNT), today announced a reverse stock split (“Reverse Stock Split”) of its shares at a ratio of 1-for-50. The Reverse Stock Split will become effective on August 8, 2025, at 5:00 p.m., Eastern Daylight Time (the “Effective Time”) and […]",
